 "hast": "\n<p>The <code>registry.json</code> schema is used to define your custom component registry.</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\">registry.json</figcaption><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"{\n  &#x22;$schema&#x22;: &#x22;https://ui.shadcn.com/schema/registry.json&#x22;,\n  &#x22;name&#x22;: &#x22;shadcn&#x22;,\n  &#x22;homepage&#x22;: &#x22;https://ui.shadcn.com&#x22;,\n  &#x22;items&#x22;: [\n    {\n      &#x22;name&#x22;: &#x22;hello-world&#x22;,\n      &#x22;type&#x22;: &#x22;registry:block&#x22;,\n      &#x22;title&#x22;: &#x22;Hello World&#x22;,\n      &#x22;description&#x22;: &#x22;A simple hello world component.&#x22;,\n      &#x22;registryDependencies&#x22;: [\n        &#x22;button&#x22;,\n        &#x22;@acme/input-form&#x22;,\n        &#x22;https://example.com/r/foo&#x22;\n      ],\n      &#x22;dependencies&#x22;: [&#x22;is-even@3.0.0&#x22;, &#x22;motion&#x22;],\n      &#x22;files&#x22;: [\n        {\n          &#x22;path&#x22;: &#x22;registry/default/hello-world/hello-world.tsx&#x22;,\n          &#x22;type&#x22;: &#x22;registry:component&#x22;\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\" data-line-numbers=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\" data-line-numbers-max-digits=\"2\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">{</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"$schema\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"https://ui.shadcn.com/schema/registry.json\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"shadcn\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"homepage\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"https://ui.shadcn.com\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"items\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: [</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">    {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">      \"name\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"hello-world\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">      \"type\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"registry:block\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">      \"title\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"Hello World\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">      \"description\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"A simple hello world component.\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">      \"registryDependencies\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: [</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">        \"button\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">        \"@acme/input-form\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">        \"https://example.com/r/foo\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">      ],</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">      \"dependencies\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: [</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"is-even@3.0.0\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"motion\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">],</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">      \"files\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: [</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">        {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">          \"path\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"registry/default/hello-world/hello-world.tsx\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">          \"type\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"registry:component\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">        }</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">      ]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">    }</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  ]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>You can also organize a large registry across multiple <code>registry.json</code> files\nusing <code>include</code>.</p>\n<mdx-expr data-flow=\"true\" data-value=\"/* prettier-ignore */\"></mdx-expr>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\">registry.json</figcaption><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"{\n  &#x22;$schema&#x22;: &#x22;https://ui.shadcn.com/schema/registry.json&#x22;,\n  &#x22;name&#x22;: &#x22;acme&#x22;,\n  &#x22;homepage&#x22;: &#x22;https://acme.com&#x22;,\n  &#x22;include&#x22;: [\n    &#x22;components/ui/registry.json&#x22;,\n    &#x22;hooks/registry.json&#x22;\n  ]\n}\" data-line-numbers=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\" data-line-numbers-max-digits=\"1\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">{</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"$schema\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"https://ui.shadcn.com/schema/registry.json\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"acme\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"homepage\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"https://acme.com\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"include\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: [</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">    \"components/ui/registry.json\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">    \"hooks/registry.json\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  ]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>Public GitHub repositories use the same source registry format. The CLI reads\nthe root <code>registry.json</code>, resolves <code>include</code>, and installs files from the\nrepository. See the <a href=\"/docs/registry/github\">GitHub registry</a> docs for more\ninformation.</p>\n<h2 id=\"definitions\">Definitions</h2>\n<p>You can see the JSON Schema for <code>registry.json</code> <a href=\"https://ui.shadcn.com/schema/registry.json\">here</a>.</p>\n<h3 id=\"schema\">$schema</h3>\n<p>The <code>$schema</code> property is used to specify the schema for the <code>registry.json</code> file.</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\">registry.json</figcaption><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"{\n  &#x22;$schema&#x22;: &#x22;https://ui.shadcn.com/schema/registry.json&#x22;\n}\" data-line-numbers=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\" data-line-numbers-max-digits=\"1\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">{</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"$schema\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"https://ui.shadcn.com/schema/registry.json\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<h3 id=\"name\">name</h3>\n<p>The <code>name</code> property is used to specify the name of your registry. This is used for data attributes and other metadata.</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\">registry.json</figcaption><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"{\n  &#x22;name&#x22;: &#x22;acme&#x22;\n}\" data-line-numbers=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\" data-line-numbers-max-digits=\"1\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">{</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"acme\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<h3 id=\"homepage\">homepage</h3>\n<p>The homepage of your registry. This is used for data attributes and other metadata.</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\">registry.json</figcaption><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"{\n  &#x22;homepage&#x22;: &#x22;https://acme.com&#x22;\n}\" data-line-numbers=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\" data-line-numbers-max-digits=\"1\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">{</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"homepage\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"https://acme.com\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<h3 id=\"include\">include</h3>\n<p>The <code>include</code> property is used to compose a registry from other <code>registry.json</code>\nfiles.</p>\n<mdx-expr data-flow=\"true\" data-value=\"/* prettier-ignore */\"></mdx-expr>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\">registry.json</figcaption><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"{\n  &#x22;include&#x22;: [\n    &#x22;components/ui/registry.json&#x22;,\n    &#x22;hooks/registry.json&#x22;\n  ]\n}\" data-line-numbers=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\" data-line-numbers-max-digits=\"1\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">{</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"include\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: [</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">    \"components/ui/registry.json\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">    \"hooks/registry.json\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  ]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>Each include path must be a relative path to an explicit <code>registry.json</code> file.\nFolder shorthand is not supported.</p>\n<mdx-expr data-flow=\"true\" data-value=\"/* prettier-ignore */\"></mdx-expr>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\">registry.json</figcaption><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"{\n  &#x22;include&#x22;: [\n    &#x22;components/ui/registry.json&#x22;\n  ]\n}\" data-line-numbers=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\" data-line-numbers-max-digits=\"1\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">{</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"include\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: [</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">    \"components/ui/registry.json\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  ]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>Included <code>registry.json</code> files may omit <code>name</code> and <code>homepage</code>. These fields are\nrequired only on the root <code>registry.json</code>.</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\">components/ui/registry.json</figcaption><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"{\n  &#x22;$schema&#x22;: &#x22;https://ui.shadcn.com/schema/registry.json&#x22;,\n  &#x22;items&#x22;: [\n    {\n      &#x22;name&#x22;: &#x22;button&#x22;,\n      &#x22;type&#x22;: &#x22;registry:ui&#x22;,\n      &#x22;files&#x22;: [\n        {\n          &#x22;path&#x22;: &#x22;button.tsx&#x22;,\n          &#x22;type&#x22;: &#x22;registry:ui&#x22;\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\" data-line-numbers=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-def